<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus komwepa da Ase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ots.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus komwepa da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Ami Obulus kpo Osilas kpo Otimoti tenena mani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Gebe ka ala ase ko oda ko Owuso Otesalonika ni wa ase ko Owuso Ada ka kpo Adole Oyesu Okristi: <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Oneshi kpo omene ko Owuso Ada kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi nayo kpa ala.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epwo Koka Eno kowowa ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ayene ka owotiri ko shotunehe do Owuso kwurutu ikweyi kala, oshoshi shini ahan ya mani, ikweyi koni otuse ni ala gbo do Owuso ni ya gye kweyi imu ni ala gbo diyikala ni ya gye neneshi. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Mani oni, aha abiyikaha ba gwabotu ikweyi kala oda ko Owuso. Aba gwabotu ikweyi kotu zoze ni ala kyogwu kpotuse kala ipu kegye kpowe ni ala bipu nu ni. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Kpiri mani ya shiya aha mo epwo koka ko Owuso wokwokwoshi la, omani shiyaha mo ala gye ko bobula ko Owuso ikweyi ko owe moma kala. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Owuso ya yoza ni wokwokwoshi ni, awase ni dala owe ni, oya dawa owe mamani, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />kweyi ala ni ke mowe ni oya dala ominyo, kpaha mamani. Omani ya gbodagye eno ni Adole Oyesu ya wa bwiso kpa ayoleho nyakwu nu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Oya da awase ni gyo Owuso lo owe kpa awase ni ba geyagye do oshu neshi ka Adole Oyesu lo. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Aba mo owe ko gbogbo-gbogbo, aba yuwa bize obutu ka Adole bwebe ko oshu nyaku nu <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Eno ni oya wa zigyashi ebe kase nu ni mo gyiyi kpa awase ni kyogwu kpa nu kpiri. Ala ki ba bipu wa, ikweyi koni ala kyogwu kpo oshu ni adala ni.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ozani ya ni aba tinarigwu dala ishi kpiri ni oma. Abo Owuso kaha na dala olayi neshi ni oya ala ogwu ko yagye kpanu ni. Ona yoko kpo oshu nu na yala mo neshi kpiri ni ala ba yimu ni shini ala yoko otuse kala kweyi. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Mani oni aba tinarigwu shini iye ka Adole ka Oyesu na pyigyashi bwebe kala, shini ala ki pyigyashi bwebe ko oneshi ko Owuso ka kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ase Bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Aba ba ala ayene, ikweyi ko wowa ka Adole Oyesu Okristi omani wi ikweyi ko ogbayi ka shini ahan yo kpa anu. <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Nyya bala ayene mala ka byotu ikweyi kela ni aba ka ni lo, maha bane, kwe aha tono, kwe aha ta ipu ko okpa mo Eno ka Adole kwobonu wa wa. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ashishe na ka gyala egya ebyibye lo. Ikweyi koni eno ni ya wa lo gbishini eno ko onu wa. Ebeni ase bibi ya bose ese kweyi ya gola. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Ase bibi oni ya tela kela ko Owuso kpo oza ni ase ma mo oshoshi ni. Oya kiyinu kweyi ya manu wose kojoji. Oya ga yagye ole ko Owuso kweyi ya ziyi nu manu wo Owuso. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ala ra lo nkela mani dala ishini nyyo kpa ala ni? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Oje ke yaba ni yoza mani walo ni, ala ke gyoza ni owe ni. Koni ishi oni wa, ase bibi mani, ya wipu kese. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Obibi ni ashishe gye lo ni kwobonu ya yoko nu wa, oza ni ke ya gbodagye mani ya gbodagye lo gbishini aya ase ni ya wobi ni yi bize imbe oya showe bita. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Kweyi ebeni ase bibi ya bose, ishini Adole Oyesu wa, oya yo ngmo kpo owu ko okwunu nu, kweyi igyashi ko wowa ka Adole yayo kya shaka-shaka. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ase bibi mani yawa kpo oshu ki Ibiri, oya ya awoza kpi igbashi ko kame nwashika, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />kweyi oya yoko kpo ozabibi wonyonya ko gyawase ni ba yishi ni egya. Aba yishi ikweyi koni atela ko yimu kokwokwoshi ni ya ngmawa ni. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ni olemani oni Owuso ya yo oziyi wa bize shini ana kyogwu kpo okame. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Mani oni kpiri kase ni kyogwu kpo okwokwoshi lo kweyi ba shotunehe kpo ozalabi, aba gekwu.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashala shini Ala Gbolayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Oke wotiri daha shan shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi kala, ayene ni Adole ya yimu ni. Koni Owuso shala shini ala wa kikyikyo ni oya ngma ala ni, bwebe koshu ko Omaku ko yala wase sere bwebe ko otuse kala ipu ko okwokwoshi. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Owuso yala ogwu bwebe ko oshu neshi ni aha ka dala ni; shini ala wa kpo okwu kala ipu ki igyashi ka Adole ka Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ni olemani oni ayene, ala hagye loshu ipu ko okwokwoshi kpo oza ni aha fala, kpo okpa ni aha ta dala ni.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Adole Oyesu Okristi abiyinu kpo Owuso Ada kaha, ni gbimu daha bwebe ko oneshi nu kweyi taho otugbagba ko gbogbo-gbogbo kpi iyitagye neshi ni, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />na ta lo otugbagba kweyi dala oshu shini ala yoza gyogye kyi kela gyogye ishi kpiri.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ala tinarigwu daha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ogwejeji nu ayene kaha, ala tinarigwu daha shini oleho ka Adole na ge ebebenya papa shini ase na gye kweyi geyagye danu, byoni ala nye kweyi geyagye danu ni. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ala kyi tinarigwu shini Owuso na ngmaha shabo kase bibi ni gbonotu ni, koni kpiri kase pini gbo otuse la lo.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Adole ke wine kokwokwoshi la, oya dala oshu ki ya gbala shabo ka Ase Bibi oni. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Kweyi ala yikpiye kaha loshu ipu ka Adole koni agye mala ba ya kweyi kyi ba gohobu ko yoza ni aha ka dala ni. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Adole na yotu kala na gyi imu nyakwu ko Owuso kweyi ala zotu ipu ko Okristi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela ko Oko Yoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ayene kaha, aba ka dala ipu ki iye ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, ala gwabo sha ayene kpiri ni ba ya ayaga kweyi ba yoza ni aha fuwa ni lo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Koni ala abiyikala gye mala shu ko yoza ni aha ya ni. Ishini aha bagye kpala ni aha ya ayaga lo. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Aha roza ka ashishe yeye lo. Abishi koni aha yoko kweyi mowe, kotu ke eno shini ahan ka wegye dala lo. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Aha ya mani koni aha gboshu ko doka koza ko tahabo lo ni lalo, aha ke ya mani shini an faloje la. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ishini aha bagye kpa ala ni, adala ono mani mo, &lt;&lt;Ase ni tela ko yoko, ona ka roza lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Aka mani ikweyi koni apwo mo ase ashini ipu kala ba ya ayaga, oko wa wako geye giso kin la. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ipu kiye Adole Oyesu Okristi aba ka dawase mani kweyi ba pyuwa akpaha mana yotu wa kagye shini ana yoko ko pyoza naba re ni. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ala ke ayene kaha, ala ka nwa ko yoza neshi lo. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Owoni ashe tela ko gboso oza ni ata ipu kokpa mani, ala yi iyi kwo neshi. Ala ka rema kpanu lo shini iweyi na kwo. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ala ka zo wo omonyekwotu kala lo, ala ke pya akpaha byo oyene.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Adole abiyinu ni wo otu ko omene kaha ni, na dala omene ipu ki ishi kpiri kpo owe wonyonya. Adole na yo kpa ala kpiri.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ami Obulus togbogba mani kpa abo hin, byoni nyya ta ipu ka awokpa hin kpiri ni; owe ni nyya ta ni yoma.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi na yo kpala kpiri.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>